/Title (Targeted record retrieval improves efficiency by avoiding the retrieval of unrelated records and the iteration through them, and efficient workflow design reduces unnecessary processing. Practices such as criteria-based fetching, avoiding unnecessary loops, using built-in operations and keeping workflows simple help applications to handle growing amounts of data. These practices contribute to scalable and maintainable Zoho Creator applications. No benchmark was performed, so the benefits are described in terms of reduced data retrieval and processing and not as measured execution times.)
